# purge needs owner confirmation: docs/REPORTS/SECURITY_INTERNAL_DOCS_AUDIT_2026-09-10.md
# NOTE: docs/publishing/ is intentionally public (scripts/build_static_reader.py builds
# docs/reader.html from it), so it is NOT excluded here.
